Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:12.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭 為什麼這麼強
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶！小空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有受傷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:25.20,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是少年救了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:30.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:35.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好美的風景啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:38.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好美麗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:20:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,累了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:20:58.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.89,0:21:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你今天救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可帥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:24.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.69,0:21:27.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 心寒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.58,0:21:29.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也輸給Precure了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:32.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼就一輸再輸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.15,0:21:37.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛... 你已經沒有退路了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:42.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我明白 我非常清楚後果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:43.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:45.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,派不上用的毫無價值
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:47.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 你的意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:53.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀... 呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:56.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,下次！下次一定打倒Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.11,0:22:00.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,向您獻上天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:08.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Yell喲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:08.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1075,970)}助援愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.29,0:22:12.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,七十二行！無所不能！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.29,0:22:12.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}無所不會！無所不能！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.41,0:23:48.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能與卡疤痛一對一單挑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 真的沒問題嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:23:52.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經決定了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.21,0:23:54.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那就要專注特訓了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.25,0:23:54.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那都要特訓些什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:23:59.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:23:59.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.97,0:24:03.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,強耶欸！Cure Sky對卡疤痛!!
